{"script":"yd_005_08-备份","exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara005_1_face_chara005_1f","layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"x":280,"scaleY":1,"trans":false,"bright":1,"y":-297,"img":"chara005_1"},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara005_1_face_chara005_1f","img":"chara005_1","nonStandBright":false,"bright":1,"scaleY":1,"x":280,"transTime":0,"y":-297,"trans":false,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"timeBak":300},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"茜塔","text":"[show]兽潮发生的时候，我所在的聚落也没能幸免。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"茜塔","text":"[show]我亲眼看着村子遭到蹂躏，我自己也差点被水生魔物夺走性命。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara005_1_face_chara005_1c","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"茜塔","text":"[show]那时赶来救援的就是菲尔德蕾老板带领的武人们，而将我从魔物口中救下的就是迦南前辈。虽然失去了双腿，但好歹是捡回了一条命。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara005_1_face_chara005_1g","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"茜塔","text":"[show]后来老板重组驿站，建立了契约制度。我和迦南前辈也在第一时间签约成为了契约者。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_6"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"茜塔","text":"[show]每一次帮助到迦南前辈，都感到仿佛偿还了一些当年的救命之恩，这让我感到挺开心的。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"end":true},"key":"end"}],"des":"茜塔-迦南的恩情"}